B.Ph=new A.aY("dynamic_pricing","Algorithmic Price Discrimination","Pricing algorithms can use your location, device, and situation to estimate what you are willing to pay, and adjust the price accordingly.","Ride-Sharing & Travel Apps (2010s)","Compare prices in a private browser or on a second device before booking anything significant.",B.bL,B.RE,"Keith Chen, NPR interview (2016)","Uber's research chief revealed that users with nearly dead batteries accept surge multipliers of up to 9.9x \u2014 though Uber states battery level is not used to set prices.",!1)
